{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2022-04-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'VERISK PUBLISHES 2021 CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY REPORT', 'text': 'JERSEY CITY, N.J., APRIL 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- VERISK (NASDAQ: VRSK), A LEADING GLOBAL DATA ANALYTICS PROVIDER,\xa0HAS PUBLISHED ITS ANNUAL CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY REPORT . THE 2021 REPORT ILLUSTRATES HOW VERISK AND ITS TEAM MEMBERS HELP CUSTOMERS AROUND THE GLOBE BETTER UNDERSTAND ISSUES, SUCH AS CLIMATE CHANGE, AND MAKE INFORMED DECISIONS AROUND RESILIENCE AND SUSTAINABILITY, AND HOW THAT WORK STRENGTHENS COMMUNITIES.'}